<title>UK: Denmark's FIH sets 400 million DKK step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark's FIH sets 400 million DKK step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINANCE FOR DANISH INDUSTRY</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKK   COUPON    *5.00	MATURITY    24.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.248   PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/=     DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	HOME CTRY   DENMARK</p>
<p> NOTES     *RISING TO 8.00 PERCENT FOR LAST THREE YEARS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
